      "text": "Heavy Rainfall Warning No. 9 #NCR_PRSD\nWeather System: Southwest Monsoon (Habagat)\nIssued at: 11:00 AM, 06 July 2025(Sunday)\n\nYELLOW WARNING LEVEL: Zambales and Bataan.\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: Possible FLOODING in flood-prone areas.\nMeanwhile, expect light to moderate with occasional heavy rains over Cavite, Metro Manila and Rizal within the next 3 hours.\nLight to moderate with occasional heavy rains affecting Pampanga, Bulacan, Tarlac(Capas, Concepcion, Bamban) and Nueva Ecija(San Antonio, Jaen, San Leonardo, General Tinio, Cabiao, Penaranda, San Isidro, Gapan) which may persist within 3 hours and may affect nearby areas.\n\nThe public and the Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Offices concerned are advised to MONITOR the weather condition and watch for the next warning to be issued at 2:00 PM today.\nFor more information and queries, please call telephone numbers 8927-1335 and 8927-2877 or log on to https://t.co/59mTpZJq1n.",
